window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>\"Trinity . . . \"</p> <p>He devised a specific road map of how they'd carry out their covenant—without input from her. She determined she needed to chart a new course in order to stay true to herself.</p> <p>Perhaps Ezra has been wrong about his gift from above. Maybe Lex has bitten off more than she can chew. At this fork in the road will they continue their detour, or will they find middle ground and a covenant that keeps them bonded for life?</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
